{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >s&amp;box is a game creation platform built on the Source 2 engine and our spiritual successor to Garry's Mod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, create, and share games, explore community creations, and experience endless sandbox fun with powerful modern tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >s&amp;box is full of games created by the community of every genre. Party up and play with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can create games using our intuitive modern editor, creating scenes with a standard scene system and a C# API with powerful hotloading.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY FUND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can publish your games directly to the platform where everyone can play it at the click of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can earn through our <strong>Play Fund</strong>\u00a0from players playing your games, directly funded from cosmetic purchases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPORT GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or if you want, you can publish your games to Steam, royalty-free. (<i>although we're not quite ready on this yet</i>)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/590830?t=1764251195","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764251195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590830/8d8d6dcb8efc2c038c551cefa7383d91ee2e5297/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764251195","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/590830/8d8d6dcb8efc2c038c551cefa7383d91ee2e5297/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764251195","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains user-generated content, which includes new games that may contain violence and bad language."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Developer Preview</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're working closely with content creators to create the editor tools, but we're not quite ready for mass adoption from players yet. See our website for more details.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >s&amp;box is a game creation platform built on the Source 2 engine and our spiritual successor to Garry's Mod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, create, and share games, explore community creations, and experience endless sandbox fun with powerful modern tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >s&amp;box is full of games created by the community of every genre. Party up and play with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can create games using our intuitive modern editor, creating scenes with a standard scene system and a C# API with powerful hotloading.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY FUND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can publish your games directly to the platform where everyone can play it at the click of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can earn through our <strong>Play Fund</strong>\u00a0from players playing your games, directly funded from cosmetic purchases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPORT GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or if you want, you can publish your games to Steam, royalty-free. (<i>although we're not quite ready on this yet</i>)</p